Z||000011||falconhulk||10-30-2001||03:43 PM||||I have a Muscle Mustangs and fast fords mag where they did this to a SN95 stang.  Said it cost just under $1000.  Dont some of the lambo kits include doors that open like this?||||reg||1
Z||000012||rogergarrison||10-30-2001||04:02 PM||||Ive improvised lots of stuff over the years, working in custom shops. There is long discussions if you search. The lambo kits are the same as real lambos-the body shape is completely different from fiero. I wouldnt even attempt doing it. But I will personnaly shake the hand and give a pat on the back to anyone who does do it...and have it work. Some of these other cars that have been done supposedly....lets see some pics, and hinge details, not just someones word that theyve done it. Then Ill believe it.||||reg||1
